The files in this repository's releases are LCM Nav3D Samples: demo levels and their art for LCM 3D Navigation AI
(LCM Nav3D). They are provided only to licensees of LCM Nav3D on Fab, as part of LCM Nav3D, under the Fab End User
License Agreement that covers it. They may not be redistributed, resold, or used apart from LCM Nav3D. They install
only through LCM Nav3D (LCM Nav3D menu > Get the Demo Levels).
